    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n109129" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποσκϋφισμός</span></b> , ὁ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκαφίς</span> (A) <i><span class="en">
